@port = 28144

### Ping
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/ping

### Test
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/test

### Generate Title
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/generate-title
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Umbraco is an open-source CMS built on ASP.NET Core, widely used for enterprise content management."
}

### Rewrite
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/rewrite
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Our product is good and helps people do stuff faster.",
  "tone": "professional"
}

### Summarize
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/summarize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Paste a long article or page copy here..."
}

### Meta Description
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/ai-copilot/meta-description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This page covers everything about Umbraco CMS setup and configuration."
}